From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritu Chaudhary <rituc@nvidia.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Dec 2024 10:30:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 214/243] NVIDIA: SAUCE: ASoC: tegra: Update ASRC ratio
 controls

Combine integer and fractional ASRC ratio controls into a single
control to avoid locking an invalid ratio at runtime due to
integer/fractional parts being updated separately.

Controls removed:
- "ASRC1 Ratio<x> Integer Part"
- "ASRC1 Ratio<x> Fractional Part"

Above controls replaced with:
 "ASRC1 Ratio<x>" which accepts value in an array of 2
 "Integer, Fractional".

Bug 4870208

Change-Id: Idbbc2087fbd41fe1a5441651494e26c95d15a86d
Signed-off-by: Sheetal <sheetal@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-on: https://git-master.nvidia.com/r/c/3rdparty/canonical/linux-noble/+/3369872
Reviewed-by: Sameer Pujar <spujar@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-by: svcacv <svcacv@nvidia.com>
GVS: buildbot_gerritrpt <buildbot_gerritrpt@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-by: Mohan kumar <mkumard@nvidia.com>
(cherry picked from commit 4b50b0282b8b281368f8e86031a54a35b300676e)

